    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The Swaran Singh Committee recommended 8 duties, but the 42nd Amendment added 10 duties; duty to pay taxes was recommended but rejected.",
        "The 11th Fundamental Duty [Art 51A(k)] regarding education for children aged 6 to 14 was introduced by the 86th Amendment Act, 2002.",
        "Fundamental Duties apply strictly to Indian citizens and are not applicable to foreign nationals."
      ],
